WEBVTT

00:07.917 --> 00:13.677
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.177 --> 00:19.767
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.767 --> 00:19.807
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.807 --> 00:28.357
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.357 --> 00:30.227
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.607 --> 00:34.157
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.487 --> 00:37.987
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.487 --> 00:40.827
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.827 --> 00:45.577
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.707 --> 00:48.917
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.877 --> 00:51.877
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.427 --> 01:01.137
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.467 --> 01:03.477
...with you.
futaride

01:04.477 --> 01:10.187
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.857 --> 01:16.277
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.487 --> 01:24.787
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.787 --> 01:26.617
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:30.417 --> 01:34.297
Once upon a time, three princesses lived in a castle.

01:34.897 --> 01:38.407
Like they did every day, they ate
umeboshi right after they woke up.

01:39.947 --> 01:41.367
Sour!

01:41.407 --> 01:42.327
Then...

01:42.367 --> 01:43.617
Looks yummy...

01:44.907 --> 01:46.037
How mysterious!

01:46.077 --> 01:48.627
The shadow was looking at them enviously.

01:54.667 --> 01:56.047
It's empty.

01:57.257 --> 01:59.887
Anyway, his future isn't so bright

01:59.927 --> 02:03.507
if he can't wake up in the morning after such a light party.

02:03.557 --> 02:06.847
Shiratori-san looks comfortable.

02:07.367 --> 02:12.067
It really makes me feel helpless,
watching him sleep so carefree.

02:12.107 --> 02:13.357
Yes.

02:14.107 --> 02:16.857
Stop it, Kozue-chan.

02:18.447 --> 02:21.067
What kind of dream is he having?

02:21.117 --> 02:26.367
I don't like how he's looking so innocent.

02:27.747 --> 02:33.957
Hey, Tama-san, I have a mucho great idea.

02:34.547 --> 02:35.547
Oh yeah?

02:35.587 --> 02:38.837
What is that, Momo-san?

02:38.877 --> 02:40.047
You see...

02:41.757 --> 02:44.887
I see, that's a great idea.

02:46.177 --> 02:47.677
CORRECT

02:47.677 --> 02:50.137
Momo-san, mascara is done.
CORRECT

02:50.137 --> 02:50.187
CORRECT

02:50.187 --> 02:52.267
Oh, that looks good!
CORRECT

02:52.267 --> 02:52.477
CORRECT

02:55.777 --> 02:58.317
OK! Finished!

02:58.317 --> 02:59.397
Yay.

03:08.707 --> 03:10.997
You finally woke up.

03:11.037 --> 03:13.747
Good morning, Shiratori Ryuko-chan.

03:14.417 --> 03:15.667
Ryuko?

03:15.707 --> 03:16.247
Here.

03:21.427 --> 03:22.677
What's this?!

03:22.717 --> 03:25.887
I knew you would be cute dressed as a girl,

03:25.927 --> 03:28.557
but I didn't expect it to turn out this well.

03:28.597 --> 03:30.887
I feel a little funny as a woman.

03:31.387 --> 03:33.647
What kind of joke is this!?

03:33.687 --> 03:36.357
Yes, you're so cute.

03:37.397 --> 03:39.027
However, Tamami-kun,

03:39.067 --> 03:43.867
Her beauty is still far from the
perfection that we're striving for.

03:43.907 --> 03:46.407
She is lacking something critical.

03:46.777 --> 03:48.697
What do you mean, Dr. Momono?

03:49.827 --> 03:50.657
Look!

03:50.707 --> 03:53.577
These are a one-way ticket to beauty!

03:53.627 --> 03:57.167
I bought them on an whim, but never wore them.

03:57.207 --> 03:58.587
They are the ultimate underwear!!

03:59.877 --> 04:03.547
Now, Ryuko-chan, put these on!

04:04.007 --> 04:04.607
Come on!

04:04.697 --> 04:05.277
Come on!

04:05.367 --> 04:05.907
Come on!

04:06.027 --> 04:07.277
Come on!

04:07.677 --> 04:09.137
NOOO!

04:09.927 --> 04:11.017
You can't get away!

04:11.057 --> 04:12.477
After him, Tamami-kun!

04:12.517 --> 04:13.977
Roger!

04:16.397 --> 04:19.527
"I usually wear these." Captured!

04:20.087 --> 04:20.777
Wait a sec!

04:20.777 --> 04:21.257
Playing such a prank...
Wait a sec!

04:21.257 --> 04:23.357
Playing such a prank...

04:23.397 --> 04:26.567
This is too mean, even if I do have a girly face.

04:26.617 --> 04:28.117
Anyway, I need to change.

04:28.157 --> 04:30.407
If people see me like this...

04:30.447 --> 04:32.517
Especially if Kozue-chan sees me...

04:34.787 --> 04:37.957
Shiratori-san, you pervert!

04:39.547 --> 04:41.457
Onii-chan, are you onee-chan?

04:41.507 --> 04:43.127
Or a pervert?

04:43.167 --> 04:45.637
Uh, no, Nanako-chan!

04:45.677 --> 04:48.827
You damn pervert!

04:50.307 --> 04:51.467
No, no!

04:51.517 --> 04:53.887
I must go back to being a man, and fast!

04:53.937 --> 04:54.887
Um...

04:56.187 --> 04:57.767
Um...

04:59.607 --> 05:03.027
The person I wanted to see least right now...

05:03.067 --> 05:06.237
If Kozue-chan treats me like a pervert...

05:06.277 --> 05:08.657
Are you a visitor?

05:09.907 --> 05:11.737
Who are you looking for?

05:11.787 --> 05:13.707
Would you like me to show you around?

05:13.747 --> 05:15.917
No, please don't mind me.

05:15.957 --> 05:17.497
Are you sure?

05:17.537 --> 05:20.207
It's a pretty big house.

05:20.247 --> 05:22.507
Really, please don't mind me!

05:29.347 --> 05:31.807
She didn't recognize me.

05:32.557 --> 05:35.997
But can't people recognize me if I'm dressed like this?

05:35.997 --> 05:37.057
Mom, I told you that you can't have any yokan until you're done!
But can't people recognize me if I'm dressed like this?

05:37.057 --> 05:41.087
Mom, I told you that you can't have any yokan until you're done!

05:47.407 --> 05:48.487
Pervert?

05:49.527 --> 05:52.487
Mom! Don't say that!

05:52.907 --> 05:54.157
You look good in those clothes.

05:54.697 --> 05:56.537
It's really nice, Onii-chan.

05:56.787 --> 05:59.247
You really look good!

06:00.037 --> 06:02.377
No, that's not it, Asami-chan!

06:04.917 --> 06:06.257
What are you looking at?!

06:06.297 --> 06:07.797
Huh?! Huh?!

06:07.837 --> 06:09.507
I understand how you feel.

06:09.547 --> 06:11.177
You went through a lot, right?

06:11.217 --> 06:12.367
No, that's not it!

06:12.367 --> 06:12.557
Found you.
No, that's not it!

06:12.557 --> 06:12.597
Found you.

06:12.597 --> 06:13.867
This is...
Found you.

06:13.867 --> 06:13.887
This is...

06:13.927 --> 06:17.017
Ryuko-chan, let's get pretty.

06:17.057 --> 06:18.307
I struck out.

06:18.347 --> 06:21.477
I'll be out as a man if I wear those!

06:21.517 --> 06:23.817
No, you only hit a foul.

06:23.857 --> 06:27.397
We'll slowly strike you out.

06:35.537 --> 06:36.117
Wha?

06:36.697 --> 06:36.807
What's going on?

06:36.807 --> 06:38.227
NO!
What's going on?

06:38.227 --> 06:38.247
What's going on?

06:40.997 --> 06:42.287
Oh, she is...

06:42.337 --> 06:43.877
Excuse me!

06:56.677 --> 06:59.267
Damn! Where is he hiding?!

06:59.307 --> 07:02.517
Oh, Kozue-chan, have you seen Shiratori-kun?

07:05.017 --> 07:08.487
Oh, what's wrong with you, wearing that?!

07:09.147 --> 07:10.067
Could it be...

07:10.107 --> 07:12.067
Oh, my.

07:17.697 --> 07:20.707
I dashed outside impulsively,

07:20.747 --> 07:25.627
but if people find me out, I'll be a huge joke.

07:25.667 --> 07:27.417
But if I go home...

07:27.757 --> 07:33.467
Here, put these on, and be born again,
Ryushi... I mean, Ryuko-chan!

07:33.467 --> 07:35.967
You're pretty, Shiratori-san.

07:37.057 --> 07:38.807
What do I do?

07:39.847 --> 07:45.567
Anyway, I really do look like a girl.

07:45.607 --> 07:48.607
It's a strange feeling, like I'm not me...

07:50.187 --> 07:51.987
What am I saying?

07:51.987 --> 07:52.717
I need to die!

07:52.837 --> 07:53.547
I need to die!

07:53.637 --> 07:54.587
I need to die!

07:55.157 --> 07:59.947
The directory said Shiratori's apartment is around here.

07:59.997 --> 08:03.077
Hey, Shiratori, I'm here to return the book you lent me.

08:03.117 --> 08:05.167
Thanks, it was useful.

08:05.207 --> 08:06.747
You didn't have to bring it here.

08:06.787 --> 08:09.337
But since you're here, why don't you stay for dinner?

08:09.377 --> 08:11.877
Yes, please stay.

08:11.917 --> 08:14.967
Oh, Miss Landlady, long time no see.

08:14.967 --> 08:16.797
Then please allow me.

08:20.477 --> 08:23.897
Oh, your cooking is splendid!

08:23.937 --> 08:25.477
It's really delicious!

08:25.517 --> 08:29.067
My! Please come by anytime.

08:29.107 --> 08:32.567
I might come back every day if
I can eat such delicious meals.

08:32.607 --> 08:33.357
My!

08:33.817 --> 08:35.407
YEAH!

08:35.447 --> 08:40.827
I might get close to that high school girl landlady!

08:43.327 --> 08:46.207
Anyway, I need to find Shiratori's apartment.

08:46.247 --> 08:48.287
Where is it...

08:50.247 --> 08:53.337
Excuse me, you pretty lady over there.

08:53.377 --> 08:54.677
May I ask for...

09:00.257 --> 09:01.717
What is this feeling?

09:01.767 --> 09:04.637
My heart is pounding.

09:04.687 --> 09:05.977
I can't breathe.

09:07.767 --> 09:09.397
It's squeezing me!

09:09.437 --> 09:11.317
What is this feeling?!

09:13.277 --> 09:14.107
You've gotta be kidding me!

09:14.147 --> 09:16.817
Why him, out of everyone?!

09:17.527 --> 09:19.577
Excuse me, miss!

09:20.157 --> 09:21.867
NO!!!!

09:22.537 --> 09:23.907
She's so cute!

09:23.957 --> 09:26.787
(NOTE: Japanese pun, koi can be love or carp)
Is this love?!

09:30.377 --> 09:32.917
I came back after all.

09:37.507 --> 09:38.927
It's quiet.

09:44.927 --> 09:46.137
Momono-san?

09:47.187 --> 09:49.557
Momono-san, what's the matter?

09:49.607 --> 09:51.067
What happened?

09:54.147 --> 09:55.067
Asami-chan!

09:56.777 --> 10:00.117
S-Sayoko-san?

10:01.117 --> 10:03.077
What is this?

10:03.117 --> 10:06.207
Oh, I haven't seen you around here.

10:06.787 --> 10:09.577
Where have you been hiding?

10:09.627 --> 10:11.537
I can't believe I missed you.

10:12.797 --> 10:15.837
Kozue-chan? Or not?

10:15.877 --> 10:19.087
Chiyuri-chan...

10:19.087 --> 10:22.057
I don't like your dress.

10:23.597 --> 10:26.977
You should be wearing more appropriate attire.

10:27.517 --> 10:31.477
No, actually, you mustn't wear that.

10:32.937 --> 10:35.437
She was the princess' shadow.

10:37.607 --> 10:38.857
I'm envious.

10:38.907 --> 10:41.407
I want to eat umeboshi too.

10:41.447 --> 10:43.737
Here you go, it's good.

10:43.737 --> 10:46.247
But I don't have a mouth.

10:48.207 --> 10:49.457
That's it!

10:50.787 --> 10:52.037
It tickles!

10:52.087 --> 10:53.747
Done!

10:54.247 --> 10:58.587
The three princesses drew a face and dress for the shadow.

10:58.627 --> 11:00.127
Thank you!

11:00.177 --> 11:02.967
Now I can eat umeboshi.

11:07.177 --> 11:08.617
Delicious!

11:11.767 --> 11:16.027
And so now, there are four princesses in the castle.

11:17.647 --> 11:19.237
Sour!

11:22.067 --> 11:23.197
Midorikawa Chiyuri

11:23.197 --> 11:24.827
Sour!
Midorikawa Chiyuri

11:24.827 --> 11:25.037
Midorikawa Chiyuri

11:35.747 --> 11:38.627
What is this room?

11:43.007 --> 11:45.717
I didn't know there was a room like this in Narutakisou.

11:45.757 --> 11:47.057
Here they are!

11:47.097 --> 11:48.307
This is it.

11:48.347 --> 11:49.637
Now...

11:50.307 --> 11:51.307
here.

11:51.347 --> 11:52.437
Huh?

11:52.477 --> 11:53.937
Don't give me that.

11:53.977 --> 11:56.437
Hurry up and change into these.

11:56.477 --> 11:58.227
I don't want that dress!

11:58.277 --> 12:00.817
Your attire isn't right!

12:00.857 --> 12:03.357
Aren't you ashamed to be dressed like that?!

12:03.407 --> 12:07.117
Sure... I'm ashamed...

12:07.157 --> 12:09.497
But I can't wear that!

12:09.537 --> 12:11.367
Yes, you must.

12:11.407 --> 12:15.917
People must not wear something that's not suited for them.

12:15.957 --> 12:20.127
What if a doctor is dressed like a police officer?

12:20.167 --> 12:22.297
It would be troublesome, causing confusion.

12:22.337 --> 12:23.467
Right?

12:23.507 --> 12:25.257
Yes, sure.

12:25.637 --> 12:28.767
That's why you must wear this maid's dress!

12:28.767 --> 12:30.137
Proper Attire
That's why you must wear this maid's dress!

12:30.137 --> 12:32.267
Proper Attire

12:32.557 --> 12:33.807
No thanks.

12:35.057 --> 12:37.727
This dress is better.

