What is the basis for it being correct?

13:02.337 --> 13:06.837
Anyway, let's get you changed.

13:08.257 --> 13:10.007
Wait!

13:10.637 --> 13:13.767
You must wear the proper attire!

13:14.767 --> 13:15.977
What's this?!

13:16.767 --> 13:21.277
I knew this would happen, so I set a trap.

13:21.317 --> 13:23.187
T-Tamami-chan...

13:24.817 --> 13:27.447
Good work, My Partner.

13:27.487 --> 13:31.327
Of course, My Sweetheart.

13:31.367 --> 13:34.157
A photo maniac and a cosplay maniac...

13:34.207 --> 13:36.207
They are a truly invincible team.

13:36.247 --> 13:40.667
Now, Chiyuri-chan, go right ahead!

13:41.297 --> 13:44.967
Now, now, let's get you changed.

13:46.927 --> 13:48.967
Stop it!

13:55.387 --> 13:58.307
My, what's wrong with me?

13:59.727 --> 14:03.067
Now that I think about it, this attire isn't right.

14:03.107 --> 14:05.067
I must correct the mistake immediately.

14:20.877 --> 14:22.167
CORRECT!

14:22.207 --> 14:25.917
Finally you have the proper attire, Asami-san.

14:25.967 --> 14:27.717
Now, next...

14:30.297 --> 14:31.177
Oh no!

14:31.547 --> 14:35.097
How could I make such a mistake?!

14:35.137 --> 14:38.437
It's apparent that the proper attire
for you is obviously the bunny outfit!

14:38.477 --> 14:39.937
Please give me a moment.

14:43.397 --> 14:46.067
Not here.

14:46.107 --> 14:47.567
Jeez...

14:54.577 --> 14:55.697
There!

14:58.407 --> 15:00.747
Good work, My Partner.

15:00.787 --> 15:04.547
Of course, My Sweetheart.

15:12.257 --> 15:13.507
CORRECT!

15:13.547 --> 15:15.517
I almost missed it.

15:15.557 --> 15:17.887
I'm glad I could correct you.

15:17.927 --> 15:18.847
Oh?

15:18.887 --> 15:22.857
I don't see Momo-san anymore.

15:24.517 --> 15:26.687
That's dangerous.

15:26.727 --> 15:32.737
If she goes out in her false attire, it
will create confusion for the world.

15:33.657 --> 15:34.717
These are...!

15:43.077 --> 15:46.417
I knew this would happen, so I set traps.

15:46.457 --> 15:48.007
Good job!

15:50.297 --> 15:52.297
That was close.

15:52.337 --> 15:54.257
Don't underestimate me.

16:01.387 --> 16:05.227
I knew this would happen, so I setup an infrared system.

16:05.647 --> 16:08.187
Good job, My Partner!

16:08.607 --> 16:11.397
Thank you, My Sweetheart!

16:15.827 --> 16:17.157
How was that??

16:17.197 --> 16:19.907
Are you satisfied with that?

16:21.827 --> 16:23.037
CORRECT!

16:23.077 --> 16:24.417
Oh, yay!

16:27.837 --> 16:31.007
You've gone pretty far again.

16:31.047 --> 16:32.297
Haibara-san...

16:32.797 --> 16:36.007
I don't care, but don't go too far.

16:36.047 --> 16:37.307
They're being greatly inconvenienced.

16:37.847 --> 16:40.727
How rude of you to say that!

16:40.767 --> 16:46.187
I consider all possibilities to find the
perfect attire for each person.

16:46.227 --> 16:49.027
Then do something about his clothes too!

16:49.067 --> 16:51.067
He never changes!

16:51.567 --> 16:52.947
Yours?

16:52.987 --> 16:53.657
Yeah.

16:54.357 --> 16:56.117
You're okay like that.

16:56.157 --> 16:57.697
Correct, correct.

16:57.737 --> 17:00.537
You don't care at all!

17:00.577 --> 17:02.207
That's not true.

17:02.247 --> 17:05.377
The green color really fits you.

17:05.417 --> 17:06.077
Fine.

17:06.537 --> 17:10.087
She says "correct" to the uninteresting people.

17:10.417 --> 17:13.927
By the way, why are you always untouched, Tamami?

17:14.857 --> 17:15.967
Come get me.

