17:19.077 --> 17:19.557
Tamami-san doesn't refuse, so she's correct.

17:19.597 --> 17:23.097
So she says "correct" to the uncaring people, too.

17:24.437 --> 17:25.267
Oh well.

17:25.307 --> 17:27.187
I've said everything I wanted to say, so I'm leaving.

17:28.107 --> 17:29.897
Wait a minute!

17:29.937 --> 17:32.607
Do something about this, Haibara-san!

17:33.067 --> 17:34.067
You are...

17:38.987 --> 17:40.617
I don't know you!

17:40.657 --> 17:42.327
I really don't know you!

17:42.867 --> 17:44.457
But Haibara-san!

17:44.497 --> 17:46.117
It's me! Shiratori!

17:46.167 --> 17:49.337
Now, thank you for waiting.

17:49.377 --> 17:53.167
Now that all the disturbances are gone, let's have you change.

17:54.667 --> 17:55.677
Fine.

17:56.047 --> 17:57.507
That's wonderful!

17:57.547 --> 18:00.347
But I will change myself!

18:00.387 --> 18:01.677
You could at least let me do that.

18:01.717 --> 18:03.017
Oh, of course.

18:18.487 --> 18:20.407
Don't peek!

18:21.697 --> 18:25.367
Why am I doing this?

18:26.407 --> 18:29.917
Oh well, I'll be free after this.

18:30.627 --> 18:32.457
Let's get it over with.

18:34.587 --> 18:37.967
It's boring not to be doing anything.

18:38.007 --> 18:42.757
Is it the most fun when you change them yourself?

18:42.807 --> 18:43.807
Correct!

18:43.847 --> 18:46.017
You know me well.

18:46.057 --> 18:48.437
Oh, thank you.

18:51.437 --> 18:53.067
Here, I'm done.

18:53.107 --> 18:54.107
How's that?

18:54.147 --> 18:55.227
Are you satisfied?

18:56.737 --> 18:58.027
This is so...

18:58.067 --> 18:59.987
You look very good.

19:01.617 --> 19:02.867
You're done, right?

19:02.907 --> 19:03.617
Bye.

19:04.197 --> 19:06.287
Wait a second.

19:06.867 --> 19:07.957
What?

19:07.997 --> 19:10.497
I dressed like I promised.

19:10.497 --> 19:13.537
It's not bad, but...

19:16.127 --> 19:20.507
It feels like something is missing to make it perfect...

19:20.547 --> 19:22.297
Missing?

19:22.797 --> 19:25.307
Could it be that these are what's missing?

19:26.137 --> 19:27.137
CORRECT!

19:27.177 --> 19:28.687
Those are it!

19:28.727 --> 19:30.137
Could those be...

19:30.187 --> 19:32.437
Momono-san's ultimate underwear!

19:33.307 --> 19:35.317
NOT THOSE!

19:35.357 --> 19:37.237
What are you saying?

19:37.277 --> 19:40.987
You will finally be correct by wearing them.

19:41.027 --> 19:43.117
No means no!

19:45.077 --> 19:46.947
Target captured.

19:46.997 --> 19:48.157
Good work, Tamami-san.

19:48.907 --> 19:50.537
I can't help it, then.

19:50.577 --> 19:54.667
I didn't want to, but I must force them on.

19:56.567 --> 19:57.317
Stop it!

19:57.397 --> 19:58.527
Stop it!

19:58.527 --> 20:00.547
It's fine.

20:00.587 --> 20:03.717
There's nothing to be ashamed of, woman to woman.

20:03.757 --> 20:05.597
You can't!

20:05.597 --> 20:06.617
Because...

20:06.697 --> 20:07.327
Because...

20:10.387 --> 20:13.017
I am a man!

20:15.687 --> 20:17.527
You're a man?

20:17.567 --> 20:19.777
How absurd!

20:20.147 --> 20:21.147
Yes, I am!

20:21.197 --> 20:22.947
I really am a man!

20:24.067 --> 20:26.527
This hair is a wig too!

20:27.327 --> 20:31.407
If you still don't believe me, go ahead
and strip me or whatever!

20:31.457 --> 20:34.667
Anyway, I am a man!

20:34.707 --> 20:37.877
Shiratori-san is desperate now.

20:37.917 --> 20:39.007
Impossible...

20:39.587 --> 20:42.547
How could such a cute person be a man?

20:42.587 --> 20:48.177
That means I've been doing this and that to a man?

20:51.427 --> 20:53.057
Chiyuri-chan?

20:53.097 --> 20:55.187
She's so innocent.

21:03.837 --> 21:06.157
Where did that girl go?

21:12.497 --> 21:16.707
Man, it really was horrible yesterday.

21:17.167 --> 21:19.837
I can't sleep easily anymore.

21:19.877 --> 21:22.667
I'd never dress like that.

21:25.007 --> 21:29.217
The pictures from yesterday are
done, Shiratori Ryuko-chan.

21:33.477 --> 21:37.147
Oh, so she was your friend.

21:38.897 --> 21:41.107
This is...

21:44.197 --> 21:46.817
I have more.

21:59.397 --> 22:05.907
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:05.987 --> 22:11.707
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:13.127 --> 22:19.587
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:19.837 --> 22:24.887
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:26.847 --> 22:33.597
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:33.847 --> 22:39.527
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:40.527 --> 22:46.367
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:46.367 --> 22:48.617
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:48.827 --> 22:54.997
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:55.497 --> 23:01.337
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

23:01.337 --> 23:05.967
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

23:22.037 --> 23:22.397
